{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:39fc09f665c41a4cf779bfd510352bc3d7b845ec465f6edfea5f1e002cd43f0a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5725641799cd957410e87da1b2175689a65a003f1ef9085f7c8389fb34bc19",
      "text": "奔向偶像试镜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765a4a175fcaca5d21d0e7659d5eeb593c001a528f44ec32ceb930bd25cdbf7f",
      "text": "试镜终于开始了。\n在面试与实技中，英雄、龙、诚司各自发挥了\n属于自己的个性与作为偶像的光彩。\n试镜结束后，意气相投的3人\n决定一起去吃饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5725641799cd957410e87da1b2175689a65a003f1ef9085f7c8389fb34bc19",
      "text": "奔向偶像试镜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6385699e276b22ae5e2372b14eadb7f11175d2d0e871432fe4290c9e46931a93",
      "text": "那么，各位。\n请坐到那边的椅子上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a26d518f9e5f9c13a516a08bec61a31ac19ec9e0dc83175dff0355ef813a23",
      "text": "那么，请依次做个简单的自我介绍，\n并说明一下应聘动机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716c15fe2919075396dd997542f633828e919e7304edd6d15ea42f229fe73842",
      "text": "我是握野英雄。前不久为止一直在当警察。\n想成为偶像的理由是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d7fd45b38c152c3361bcb1ff317d6fd92e9dc5e11569f0b97c7a85db7c68a47",
      "text": "……我至今为止，亲眼目睹过许多因各种原因\n而失去容身之所的孩子们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c6fe28257916a504860b70f19230edaac6c245059511f5c16036e88b08c942",
      "text": "那些孩子紧紧封闭着内心，\n身为警察的我的话语，根本无法传达给他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8261825a24baf22fcd851f838ddbb2150db90299b9cf524770bf8f8f91d805",
      "text": "但是……在大家身处的地方，\n总有“偶像”这一存在以及歌曲相伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ad3b9ace5747ac0e33eeb5d327164e71e1bbbdd66dae65b5e539ebbd4a9d3a",
      "text": "如果成为偶像，我的话或许就能传达给他们，\n说不定就能更加贴近孩子们的心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867b6bc06036e0d253692e4e43e42587401a0deab95fb0da097590d7a6131d91",
      "text": "为了成为孩子们的精神支柱，\n我想走上偶像这条道路。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecbbb67d823c27ec48a9426bdff5d9cfafa952e7e131ce71f6d726876c0e4121",
      "text": "我是木村龙。之前是消防员。\n请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31734188bb8dee8dc91ea25bc94014cdb889f536268ebeb33e5287fe378c189",
      "text": "您看了寄过去的那份通知对吧。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e77296cfd8ec68e3b2ef85d98d4f2a73b2438cad96494c27cb3c238aeb60cd3",
      "text": "给我寄信的人，原来是您吗？\n哇，太好了，终于见到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8685ce05c9d007b8780421a095b08c12d2bf32cc5f36d2021aa08829df502c75",
      "text": "是的。看到了您英勇保护偶像的身影，\n我就很希望您能来参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51c4245c9090f8a07458002651f3ca543db2514fc6533ca00b20b7543412b360",
      "text": "啊哈哈……那次只是碰巧变成那样\n罢了。而且我也收到了很多斥责的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd1361ff6e080f100051ce4848e698d275dd7d07d14c9e929fd08c082769421",
      "text": "虽然同事们有鼓励我。\n但说实话，我的心情一度跌到了谷底。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c4f8930715ad35ccebb78fb0001fa4276651806c1ca55e1d562c5be4a273aec",
      "text": "……因为我总会因为各种霉运和意外，\n给身边的人添很多麻烦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5871842fdb5dbd5f59d82a6a5839d040e18ae285496d25026e9535f5f5511e51",
      "text": "我当时甚至觉得可能再也坚持不下去了，\n连我自己都差点放弃了自己。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14944d4d287e0c1801aa2de8436ba4af862ee5189ec4e0d6a8c7c7636e960e63",
      "text": "就在那个时候，我收到了来自您的、\n参加这场试镜的邀请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa333b8c8dfd27e5b156184aec816913c5f055d11684e826b25cec1a38a3f3a",
      "text": "我有一个梦想，就是成为日本第一的消防员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbc6ad73877660f4f86997fdb754fe2a92d9dbd2bcf9ac6054165b8effba67eb",
      "text": "小学时的体验学习中，我了解到了消防员这份\n勇于面对危险火灾、救死扶伤的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd27f2ee4a45d4ebc88a186b3f7ad8f4dd67a6ba8298efd78524e5f8b2dc679a",
      "text": "之后，我也真的当上了消防员……\n虽然因为这次的风波，不得不辞职了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d14114ecde97a145504841f2d8f04633fae83df67d3972e87d2845f2f797a39",
      "text": "但如果成为偶像，就能做消防员的工作。\n还能像被我救下的那个女孩一样，当上消防署长！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18595f416733a0b082c366ccb7292f36b2e462559f78ba6f361999f5fb9eabf2",
      "text": "还有那个可能性，还可以不用\n放弃……让我看到了希望。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d7e901d380ef581648f8ed1bdb1591a64d4198c9b4e500e1dcba449e314782a",
      "text": "我想通过成为偶像，\n去实现从小就一直憧憬的梦想！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3569792b770f30800edd16f2ac7486656b32dc39bd760268e61d2e09b6ecc2",
      "text": "我是信玄诚司，前自卫官。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6d0ca60a4067dcdffb879ac8717b28589a9cc277d3ccab3a389de71b4b1fad",
      "text": "特长那一栏里写着\n“枪械分解与组装”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a0fbaa8cb25e40efa06529771b86176b62e174923eb3193321ebe10a5c8e6b",
      "text": "这是一个怎么样的项目呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6393e3260ce267ed4dca5885339cb035f056299d0749660e692e2263dcca364",
      "text": "自卫官作为训练的一环，\n会进行枪械的分解与组装。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b96b6c79a46f329506ef075b939da72783d79d9be1dc8a9359f3971d9b7dafc",
      "text": "通过这项训练，可以准确掌握枪械的结构，\n并能进行妥善的保养。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a22f5f987bb6ee32c0d49baf8d61bc5c78d43e899d9db8a408cbe49f271704",
      "text": "起初细小零件很多，吃了不少苦头，\n但在反复训练后，手就会自然记住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8312629ddb99bd6deeaa740b4b9b01e021c6df553c3ab07f3124ac6a74eab96",
      "text": "如果是89式步枪，我大概花\n5到6分钟就能完成全部组装。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11b4122debdfd0cb5f9998605e917172e0c3d444f60f0704b5d288706094000b",
      "text": "哇啊……感觉好厉害。\n改天请务必让我见识一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02ec50b17070b817ab90d5d44635a68b8920750132ebb137fc0dec9697f374e8",
      "text": "哈哈，一定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3661de961d905e1f2bfa861e6145add0f5d59767cfdc7d130f4ec557b917b16d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n接下来，能再听听您的应聘动机吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d5742e377c4c67d9935e7b72865797c1637ebc93f812ed8a832314c82a85d9",
      "text": "好的。我开始考虑偶像这份\n工作，是在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:412d11da99f9e4c1ad4c16a9582b4ed162d932db1de525cf22e8dc3e38343ffd",
      "text": "那么，接下来进入实技考核。\n请表演事先通知各位的课题曲与舞蹈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af47a1b4661f0a24a02297b80d339cff0e6c695b512ad13cc39d128da854ceb3",
      "text": "～～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7d6e5082b2d596e98520ed357ff7eb7467e72bdec6a21606e130c7cd9e29d3",
      "text": "三位的表演都充满力量感呢，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401835d408919a868fafc1dded949e50b5dabeebe4b9470f37b76b3645a555e2",
      "text": "是啊。而且不仅仅是强劲有力，\n还能感受到想要将歌声传递给对方的体贴与温柔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b46748c2e89d504b1f6c97615b82106a6402530abbcaadffc68e275c301eb469",
      "text": "如果这三个人作为偶像，\n站在大众面前的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:237babab32930823b7fc0f9af5cd4f27decf3e19bf8e3f904fbdc73e45a0cf08",
      "text": "我想大家一定会被极其\n温暖的心情所包围的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9eca332669125293cb8792e4831c86b57cc4551335fb97036c7cd3777e345db",
      "text": "各位，试镜到此结束。\n今天非常感谢大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee7ae12a5e67326431839ac7d40be348105d85802089039bbfaa3cb026a43ff7",
      "text": "失陪了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8be1b5725ea2789dcfb36fedaca369fbbdd62e93b5715ef28b23f4f51973460b",
      "text": "非常感……！哇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000213:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba81e3a301f3e366d2c32840229e56aa0498221c8636e13ab30ab5b7ea1d1cb8",
      "text": "没事吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000227:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60689d79580debac47d29d65d65391e11ba91f3bad71a14f891a9334ac4df821",
      "text": "没、没事！只是踩到了鞋带！\n啊哈哈……失陪了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_d:cmd-000235:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90cc0fc50bb7e3efa5d9a2e4773e2464d983bcd45bb27b99c4b765b154264994",
      "text": "（呜呜，在最后的最后倒了大霉～！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a05de2825e6fb075890bb346aa3bb54444e099649dcaca5e43bed0e288b1f131",
      "text": "你们两个，辛苦了。\n感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1864056d7294ff196fa5c50647d2e1158be5ef6a6e7d76516280b6eb9e7d178b",
      "text": "虽然竭尽全力了，\n但最后摔了一跤。不要紧吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85be70e5f297b32d988035239cdfa680fd53d9550fcfc5e26b6fb696b940d584",
      "text": "不过，诚司先生和英雄先生的歌唱和舞蹈\n都太棒了！肯定能合格的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d623873ad803185d951cb17710054f398ad8813757848ade7e77dd8d91ce3061",
      "text": "龙，你也很棒啊。所以，别那么沮丧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2d7ef26edb058418f0c9388cd10af56d2daa602c8d95bec54398d5d7f123f5e",
      "text": "我们三个人，都在不熟悉的试镜场合中\n倾尽了全力。首先为这点感到自豪吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13a866e4f04193094db2fdd55b96aa4d7ce6f1361fb65984bde967a5802278e",
      "text": "诚司先生……您说得对。反正事到如今也只能\n等待结果了，闷闷不乐也没用呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:821488f72936677fc92383fea38286d1cb9bcba0b7a8d0e733bd2d636f9576c6",
      "text": "喂，要不我们就顺便一起去吃个饭？\n就当是纪念大家一起参加了试镜的缘分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad8b24bc690aaf91ed6efb0babd2607ef421971ff5251d8d6cbf4f987791557e",
      "text": "太好了！\n我好像因为一直紧绷着神经，肚子饿得咕咕叫了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374102bcdfb0ff0059beafc422ea102dd3e574e5294cf08d810e7df57b91f9bf",
      "text": "哈哈，我也是。\n大概是因为脑子和身体都超负荷运转了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:975d19dbeaaf01d0512d8991ba5b20918a9a9fa43902e24319b1400fc989ab9b",
      "text": "那就这么定了吧。\n龙，你想吃什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14112321209e167645a70b3bafa8961ae1d3cc6c5f99c898a6216c7881bdbe23",
      "text": "我想吃米饭！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ec6cc693626f51ad3f9da1034435d9099e8b55d1249a6672cf49a22bb586ea",
      "text": "啊，除了米饭没别的了对吧？\n走，去吃个饱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cbe627c95de5a62bd5f39580d39db87faad3ab8a2240c69ec5ee7f3d604923f",
      "text": "家庭餐厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:655f3aaf4ddf3cc08493f99f12c6adeb70c04da02181c7cafc9836509411c937",
      "text": "啊，两位都选好了吗？\n我去叫店员过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4599077936b13cfa3ceb769d987d8975bdfa4a3d15ae0b276eb074d8e19e3965",
      "text": "让您久等了。请问要点些什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c3d245f5b479916fa17ee07afeb5d94cdc6682392b28e4fc5c44426b7f62d92",
      "text": "请给我一份汉堡肉排拼盘。\n套餐的米饭要大碗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd39a39bd94108c4cf1fae4f901ffaae307282473679a54155f7a9bf237870d",
      "text": "我要这个今日特选午餐，\n甜点请上一份松饼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7af8d26e5e4ce9e829d3184d734fd38caa9dce262b989cad39f5c638ea70ba2f",
      "text": "我要烤鱼定食，\n米饭请盛大碗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7436cc590c3777b1aeb772663b8bac5588f83810405a4420fa3e48f0277dfbc",
      "text": "好的！\n请稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1573b4a3a3883f4697c421ee72b605c53a92d1f50e5e4af09f38b48154cfe7d",
      "text": "英雄喜欢吃甜食吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41512bf4e8407f59e109e9a3ea11429e492a82e10281a19bccc9ed3ad0bd1f5f",
      "text": "嗯。其中松饼更是格外特别啊。\n只要菜单上有，就会忍不住点一份。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db419fe1abac2ba400230185cb081d85acd30c1bab42f1c3cfb6aeaece6a4b32",
      "text": "松饼啊。\n我也点一份当甜点尝尝看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b76430aae97ebdd4afe13f720af5ba29be0c64ba268f8a7db254a211172f4b5e",
      "text": "……话说回来，\n诚司先生想成为偶像的理由。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9b6d0a48c76fef9ccc4e14647fe4f340fd4d6eff1325c1e50801661fbb5b28",
      "text": "刚才试镜时在旁边听着，听得我热血沸腾。\n该说是被您那强烈的决心打动了呢，还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_f:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93",
      "text": "这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15892878b9a40f50e9a647800aac00eeafad70a1c96c51753d2e5ae5d3d3b36e",
      "text": "就像在试镜时说的那样，\n我是因为外甥女的笑容才萌生这个念头的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bea426c9612a9b67261d2461965220a8bb5ad8e7439a04fd81103733fea3a2f3",
      "text": "就算无法再作为自卫官，\n我也想作为偶像守护全世界的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a54ddb9a096c16c9647e2371f29de9ee9d29fd48cddaf8b4a1a68e886c84e83",
      "text": "虽然我是个粗人，\n但如果能成为偶像，我打算竭尽全力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ec8cd6c9cd580ad19e504b86a0c10f7b713044430191c4c59a8513cb5c87952",
      "text": "诚司先生和英雄先生，\n都是为了大家的笑容而努力拼搏的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ea491324960656fad16eeb03ff94897fcbca77ad4d37989284343713e9f726c",
      "text": "龙不也是一样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b38a396884922362a7eaf365ced150df6f34f8199959c7e80ae671d929561af2",
      "text": "就像你自己说的那样，龙至今所做的，\n是面对危险、救助他人的工作。我很佩服你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3da69f17f26fa04446f4253f3b8dea0d1b198b81b05158b0970e8dfa4c03f7",
      "text": "……向这么可靠的两位坦白虽然稍微\n有点丢脸……其实，我有一件挂心的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a6081ddfb00240e5d9bb828ee929993b7d3105b7c8485d0764e80c893a7e7c4",
      "text": "那个……我很不擅长面对女性。\n一站在面前，总会紧张得不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9773f3a59932a6d0dc7792ae2790b55d7f4cd8cfd66d84c9fe1b964cad68d5",
      "text": "这样吗？不过我记得偶像好像在演唱会\n或者握手会之类的，有很多和观众接触的机会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca1ae27b919c5b7927016fb0ad7a3944045db477fb4d09d80653bbd3f36ac75e",
      "text": "这么说来，\n跟女性接触的机会也相当多吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3467ce68e15747f4cedc70bec79efacb356f309144c56278ecef12f7a8a51c0b",
      "text": "果、果然是这样吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee2777e7c1dfdf53a2ae8921eebef920ebc8827c071410f560c2569f886b54d9",
      "text": "到时候总会有办法的！\n我们一起想想该怎么做吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b825f11419a921b8a696975437d20099b5632b047a2e34415978e2fb6113997",
      "text": "谢谢你们两个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:280a12ae11b534291234067a4acc6bdf4740161e18b1015400750cafec320bf3",
      "text": "让各位久等了，\n这是您点的餐点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2a39aa23265c52312b3bf20270fae9aacbe77b525e39a082b5774393d8e0b81",
      "text": "哦，看起来很好吃啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ea6e9bbfc5b5b57d79560d8624b6a3aa37469422003bccd32d41a3fab196486",
      "text": "那么，不管怎样先填饱肚子吧！\n……我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_g:cmd-000188:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419a9a223da5a818334f895ebd757b43708602df4ee2ff5be4e6749114983674",
      "text": "我开动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3db3a42d9b966018020a11584e5daca095992592800bfea252f0b3daeadf30eb",
      "text": "315 Production·社长室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9cac7b932e0821b8a2be859504e811f0d78ac3fd3c1be446fa4cfeefe3a754",
      "text": "下一位是……\n握野英雄先生、木村龙先生、信玄诚司先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc15818765f85f8cf397ea78817601efa0a4eeb09bf9f35312f6cbba408930a3",
      "text": "如果是这几位的话，\n我想一定能成为优秀的偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bed55e93714a70b2b2f0b438587a543495df06691c634df927077c712acda06",
      "text": "啊，我也深有同感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cf4ce6efbf3c5db3ea9c6b47b11469da09641fc5801bc998ba8a6ac9c5a8ad5",
      "text": "两位请用茶。\n选拔进展得如何了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2995a7701140ac49dd1f69f0111804ce634857bec3b8e88a216b9c16e61a1288",
      "text": "很顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:555a61ca4d74dcfba30b62933d6351c7d088a6d18de1e1a823caea9970558e95",
      "text": "啊。是前阵子那几位前公务员吧。\n我也记得很清楚！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6182c585c28aa1d10171d028874e8c858b46112d78f734a784444767415f1cd",
      "text": "虽说至今为止有各种履历的人\n参加了试镜，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2b273bde6ea62cd2627a0fbdcb97c50b1731c5683912356b7438796d33fbb9",
      "text": "前警察、前消防员、前自卫官，\n印象真的非常深刻呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eee60681c7173bad0dce0e40eede764dbbe7af9d7bb2d864a41f6af8ee945c5",
      "text": "是啊。不仅如此，\n我也感受到了他们作为偶像原石的光芒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc55fa0ef63adcedaf5b34de04c20a9e3d01587e15aa9abc4dc2dfd475c28d0",
      "text": "（社长的眼神也仿佛在说“感受到了绝佳的热情！”。\n……既然如此……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52dd68b6087f9544051d7738b3902fcbd90b7cc7b7ff99ea4a28ef9e4530865b",
      "text": "呼……\n……约翰，好重啊～……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "text": "我回来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd89f257142050564c126e35a21c5c25795bc50071eccd30dd58a63aee353ef9",
      "text": "哥，快醒醒！\n有你的信！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad43cbe39b96ec7cf25675797262d4d3bc92a93848ec51b78f23f18dbf8e7135",
      "text": "好痛！\n……干嘛啊～，我正睡得舒服呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2059e6f6b6781995315c30f9a3d7b5d3e06147387a4a84881516462b18763dbc",
      "text": "信？哪里寄来的？……315 Pro……\n315 Production！是试镜的结果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2403d76b91561bbe3594c9161a5e69f9dd74efb8c9ba5b518eee16f9231cbbde",
      "text": "……“关于本次试镜结果，特此\n通知您已被录取，内容如下”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b6d5eeb88b8a8b4ae053dd52979b0284d121a5324cbf7360e7a328e6764db5",
      "text": "……录取了！？真的合格了？\n我没看错吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:506e02927ae061a6caf191a85b1cbc545cd13604c66ac27121a125fa6040de37",
      "text": "合格了，我合格了！\n太好啦——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f54da720bfbdba0099a41edd92b082ed4cd94f6291daed5079df9d49c0256bc",
      "text": "汪汪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334b4adf810902de19beb06526f449911d1bb0687adbdbe401a97738a067f929",
      "text": "今天是第一次见面碰头。好紧张啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93b526296733685469a942486bee1fad0d918cb9e05ac8592c46b278a12195dc",
      "text": "根据地图，这里就是\n315 Production的大楼……对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:515ede280545c5ab1e0c93d0d7b12c911403671a41bf2d7a7dfc2129d3600e4a",
      "text": "（感觉比想象中要小巧很多，\n真的没找错地方吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d05f44dc537f200f952338395f6312ab3a0129156948d1937e209ceacd4518",
      "text": "那个，我是收到了合格通知的木村龙。\n今天请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd1f16882857a04ab24b6078c3327e3b65606a84b1aff91160eb43c4340d5ca0",
      "text": "木村龙先生，久等了！\n其他人也已经到了哦。我这就带您过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fece6cb32112b7a99e7664548e3caa46703287ebfb7a6f12dec9d556a99f6b6",
      "text": "来，这边请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1de30f08029e2fc5a75bf46f93fc402cfaee6d99306ee8de66a245345b40f75d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n……哎，等等，诚司先生！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d999c8276d35f05c6fec4218ab3a05870f68b60aa655ef8b97915a934d3eb9c",
      "text": "龙，你也合格了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a58d67cfd9ae5ff63e58e16faa94f7919c7718522b17b8b9c8ed8686611f694",
      "text": "打扰了……\n哦，信玄！还有龙也在！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec26d15fb1065150a40f19700dc1a92cc645d9e1abfa6fbe784cdced370a544",
      "text": "太好了……！我们大家都合格了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f1a4cffc597605a8b3786ffeaf0f0ea8deea9cd96e77e57798a0b7c5b42b9c",
      "text": "各位。欢迎来到315 Production！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_j:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cd9678d7f0a7c0795dc000699db06a5e8bf63b7aaf5f2e6e3e0a4e1e3b6cd1",
      "text": "事不宜迟，请容我向大家说明今后的规划！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
